Ele mesmo! Sam, mas!

791
01:31:16,232 --> 01:31:17,931
Ele mesmo!

792
01:31:17,933 --> 01:31:19,700
- Sam, mas. - Sam, pare!

793
01:31:19,702 --> 01:31:22,470
No!

794
01:31:22,472 --> 01:31:23,772
